{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/4072-geist-revised","id":4072,"title":"Geist revised?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-05T22:47:28-08:00","id":4072,"title":"Geist revised?","content":"ISTR hearing something about a rules update for Geist's corebook. I don't know if this was supposed to be part of the God Machine or not, or if it was errata or a more complete rules rewriting. Has this happened yet, or is it still coming?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-05T22:50:51-08:00","id":4076,"title":"","content":"They did a Geist 1.1 a while back, which amounted to a debugging of the book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-05T23:02:08-08:00","id":4089,"title":"","content":"Rich replied to a comment on one of the Monday Meetings that the Errata/Revisions that Ethan did were baked into the PDF version available on DriveThruRPG. That's the only hard fact. Everything else is Rich being a tempter and a tease...<br /> Which I guess is par for the course.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://whitewolfblogs.com/blog/2013/10/22/ok-enough-with-the-ear-stuff-already/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://whitewolfblogs.com/blog/2013/10/22/ok-enough-with-the-ear-stuff-already/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://whitewolfblogs.com/blog/2013/10/22/ok-enough-with-the-ear-stuff-already/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://whitewolfblogs.com/blog/2013/10/22/ok-enough-with-the-ear-stuff-already/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>ST/DM for <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfFy7kNgMvxIR1qdzT8PzEg\" target=\"_blank\">Dice Alternatives</a><br /> Playing: <a href=\"http://causality-and-consequences.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">DtD: Causality and Consequence</a><br /> Off-Season: <a href=\"http://lifelong-educations.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">M:tAw- Lifelong Education</a>","edited":{"userid":667,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/667-abenniton","user":"ABenniton","date":".  Added the link for the MM Notes that have the info. 11-06-2013, 02:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/667-abenniton","name":"ABenniton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar667_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-04T05:18:26-08:00","id":23070,"title":"","content":"On the old White Wolf forums there was a thread with contact info for those who had the old Geist and if you took your photo holding it you could send it to someone at Drivethru RPG and they would send you a copy of the Geist 1.1 pdf. I know as of March this year they were still doing this. Is the offer still available? Since the old forums are gone I can't find the info. What's up?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1511-vonkarolinas","name":"vonkarolinas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-04T17:30:59-08:00","id":23402,"title":"","content":"If they do, I hope they keep it strictly to mechanical revisions. I like the fluff of Geist as it is, and I'm not really a fan of the fluff of the GMC.<br /> <br /> But that's just me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-04T18:35:50-08:00","id":23434,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Allan53</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/4072-geist-revised?p=23402#post23402\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If they do, I hope they keep it strictly to mechanical revisions. I like the fluff of Geist as it is, and I'm not really a fan of the fluff of the GMC.<br /> <br /> But that's just me.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u2026The fluff of the GMC that has absolutely nothing to do with Geist's metaphysics and that, if word on the other Chronicle Books is any indication, was not ever going to really intrude on the other game lines' bases? That fluff?<br /> <br /> It seems exceedingly irrational to think that the Kerberoi Chronicle is going to be anything other than a mechanical update and a conceptual refinement.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-04T23:08:47-08:00","id":23555,"title":"","content":"I never said it was <i>likely</i>, I just said I don't want it to happen because, as you point out, they have nothing to do with each other, so forcing them to would end up with some godawful mess.<br /> <br /> If it's not going to happen, yay!<br /> <br /> By the way, I don't keep 100% up-to-date on every single update WW does. So, lay off the 'irrational', it's irritating.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-04T23:48:57-08:00","id":23569,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Allan53</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/4072-geist-revised?p=23555#post23555\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">By the way, I don't keep 100% up-to-date on every single update WW does. So, lay off the 'irrational', it's irritating.</div> </div> </div> </div>A cursory glance over the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/schedule\" target=\"_blank\">schedule</a> reveals no mention of the God-Machine in the Chronicle Book blurbs nor those of their associated Fiction Anthologies, and all references to those books as &quot;GMC updates&quot; for other lines by the fandom thus far have been talking about mechanics.<br /> <br /> It takes maybe a minute to do the first thing and an undefined but small amount of gradual observation to conclude the second. I've gone off on people for taking one immediately-shouted-down misreading-post as proof that a book saying a thing that it didn't say would lead to sanctioned Mage Imperialism. You can put up with having an irrational worry called irrational.<br /> <br /> The Kerberoi Chronicle adjusting the Thresholds so that Tzeentch is a sixth Horseman would be a highly unlikely godawful mess that I predict will not come to pass with about one one-millionth of a percentage point of uncertainty. Posts expressing your hope that something that is almost literally never going to happen doesn't happen therefore look like you were casting about for an excuse to complain about a thing you don't like. Complaining about a thing you don't like in a place that's not set aside for doing so does nobody any good; you've given other people useless information out of nowhere and you've drawn the ire of people who don't appreciate having their time wasted like that.<br /> <br /> It especially doesn't help that you're complaining about a hypothetical way-unlikely outcome in a hypothetical at-least-two-years-away-from-being-pitched GMC-era chronicle book for Geist <i>\u200bin a thread that is about the errata'd &quot;1.1&quot; version of Geist that came out in early 2012.<br /> <br /> <b>Which was mentioned in all three of the posts immediately preceding yours.</b></i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 12-05-2013, 02:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T00:00:12-08:00","id":23579,"title":"","content":"Or, crazy idea, I don't look over the schedule because I have better things to do with my day, and pop onto the forums to discuss a hobby I enjoy, not to get into a &quot;well, I'm more up-to-date than you&quot; fan-off? And even if I do read it, I don't remember everything?<br /> <br /> Ok, it's not going to happen. This is a good thing. I am pleased about this.<br /> <br /> I am so very sorry that I was worried about it. How can I ever live with myself? And moreso, I then <i>expressed my concern without examining every possibility</i>. I'm such a terrible person. Thank God you're here to point that out and show the correct way of enjoying the hobby. Otherwise, someone might have simply pointed out the unlikelihood of my concern coming to pass in a polite and non-insulting fashion, and I would have gone on being a <i>bad fan</i> who likes complaining about a hobby I enjoy, particularly my favourite gameline, by expressing worry that a system I enjoy mostly because of the fluff would have the fluff changed like most gamelines that have been updated to GMC, to one extent or another.<br /> <br /> From now on, I'll do the right thing: I will do detailed examination of everything WW has said, analyse it all with regard to source, past accuracy, likelihood of change, and time, and only post totally certified and inarguable conclusions to avoid wasting peoples time, because god forbid I waste peoples time by posting an incorrect post in a relevant thread.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T00:24:17-08:00","id":23589,"title":"","content":"It's categorically unhelpful when you turn my expecting you to do <i>any research at all</i> or demonstrate <i>basic reading comprehension</i> into me supposedly trying to start a pissing contest and declaring you to be a terrible person who is having badwrongfun for not being omniscient.<br /> <br /> This is not the thread for complaining about impossibilities concerning a hypothetical GMC update for Geist. You'd know this if you had read the original post, the second post, the third post, or indeed any part of the thread before your first post besides the title. You made a goof. That's generally survivable if you don't keep picking at the reaction it produces. Instead you're hurling hyperbole at me for being miffed that you took having a long-shot worry of yours called unreasonable as something to snap at. Let it be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 12-05-2013, 03:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T00:36:28-08:00","id":23593,"title":"","content":"No, I will not let it be. I DID read the earlier posts, and I thought my view was relevant (it was talking about the possibility of an upgrade, I was talking about how I'd like the upgrade to go). I was wrong. It happens. However, you ride in and start calling me irrational because I made a simple mistake? That's you being a git. You could have very easily just pointed out how in the schedule it doesn't say that, so it's unlikely. But no. You wanted to start insulting me, and now you're confused that I won't just take it. You're being a tool, and maybe I'm being a tool too, but at least I'm responding to you. What's your excuse, Mr. I-know-everything-and-never-ever-ever-make-a-mistake?<br /> <br /> By the way, the schedule? It changes. It's updated. It's not ever carved in stone. Conceptual ideas go in a different direction than expected, and WW doesn't always announce everything in perfect detail months in advance. So my concern was completely valid, if unlikely to eventuate in the way I thought. If you don't like it, suck it. You're the one who was rude, I was, at worst, misguided.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T00:47:55-08:00","id":23597,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Allan53</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/4072-geist-revised?p=23593#post23593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">However, you ride in and start calling me irrational because I made a simple mistake? That's you being a git.</div> </div> </div> </div>While I appreciate the name-calling as much as anybody, I feel as though there's an error in communication being had here.<br /> <br /> When I said the worry you expressed is &quot;irrational,&quot; I meant that in the sense that my friend's coulrophobia is irrational \u2014 the likelihood of him actually having anything substantial to fear from clowns is incredibly low and it's unreasonable for him to be so terrified of them.<br /> <br /> It is not an insult to say that his irrational fear that a clown will be somewhere and do horrifying things to or near him despite no evidence that this should happen is irrational. It is likewise not an insult to say that your irrational worry that the writers will overtly put the plot driver for the chronicle book for mortals into the chronicle book for Sin-Eaters despite no evidence that this should happen is irrational.<br /> <br /> Is that misunderstanding cleared up?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T01:09:12-08:00","id":23603,"title":"","content":"Ironically, the topic has been almost entirely derailed.<br /> <br /> To put it back on track, I'm not sure if they're still giving out Geist 1.1 updates to people who have a hardcopy of the book and send in a photo of them holding it. I did this myself a few months back (albeit maybe a bit late?) and haven't heard so much as a peep. If anyone tries it and gets a reply, please let us know!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/933-shadowhowler","name":"shadowhowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T01:15:07-08:00","id":23606,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b>Cool down.</b></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"co